WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.080
In the beginning there was nothing.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.420
So the world was grey and lifeless.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.800
But then there was the First Flame,

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.580
which brought warmth, life and light.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
But these things cannot exist alone,

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.800
so there was also the Disparity.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.460
Cold, death and dark.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.580
Humans were born from the Dark,

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.440
but we are drawn toward the Light.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.780
We are warmed by fire, but this fire we can not touch.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.800
For those whose fascination with fire persists

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.780
learn to hold it in their own hand.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.500
Pyromancy is born from the saturation of fire.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.400
But you must remember one thing.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.500
"Always fear the flame,

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.060
lest you be devoured by it, and lose yourself."

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.860
"I would hate to see that happen again…"

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.660
It is the nature of fire to fade, until only dark remains.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.520
But what if another flame was borned?

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.800
It could be a replica of the first to ward off the Darkness.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.660
The Witch of Izalith was one of lord Gwyn's last hopes.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:05.720
If she could replicate the First Flame

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.720
then the gods power would never fade.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.940
It would have been better

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.440
if she never tried.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.820
"Hmm… I have a favour to ask.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:16.980
My mother...

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.840
... the Witch of Izalith...

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.700
...was one of the primeval Lords.

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:25.740
Her power came from the soul that she found near the First Flame.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.360
She focused this power...

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.320
...to light a flame of her own...

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.060
...but she failed to control it.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.580
The Flame of Chaos... engulfed Mother and my sisters...

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:39.860
...and molded them into deformed creatures."

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:46.100
"Below us lies the ruins of the legendary city of Izalith.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.200
There, the Molten Giant watches over the Flame of Chaos.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:56.460
Our Fair Lady, and Mistress Quelaag, fled from the ruins.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:01.100
I do not know the details… and I do not ask…"

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:04.600
When the Witch of Izalith attempted to create the First Flame

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.040
something went wrong.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:09.960
She created a Bed of Life, which would become the source of all demons.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:13.060
There were originally seven daughters of Chaos.

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:16.360
The Witch and two sisters were bound to the Bed of Chaos.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.080
The Witch is trapped inside

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.120
and her two sisters became the orbs beside her.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:24.980
Quelaag and The Fair Lady were bound to giant spiders.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.560
One sister was corrupted... and guards her mother.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.700
Another sister was sacrificed and is watched by her brother,

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.480
who became the being of Ceaseless Discharge.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.200
Only Quelana remains.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:39.980
"And now I am here.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:43.280
But my mother and sisters have been in anguish since.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:44.940
I beseech you...

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:50.740
Free Mother and my sisters from the Flame of Chaos. I cannot do it myself.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.220
I lack the strength...

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.820
...and the bravery…

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.340
But you…

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.680
I realize what I am asking.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.080
But please...

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.860
...free their poor souls…

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.780
Quelaag, the deformed daughter of Izalith,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:11.100
she escaped with her sister, and they fashioned the home at a base of Blight town.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:15.160
The denizens of Blight town were chosen as servants and food.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.860
But The Fair Lady felt for the suffering of her disfigured followers

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.580
and sucked out their blight pus.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.200
She poisoned herself.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:27.880
"I'm so sorry, dear sister."

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.980
And so the Fair Lady started to die.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.140
But at least she has her sister Quelaag.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.220
"But promise me…

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:41.380
...that you will take care of yourself."

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.520
Quelaag kills everyone who enters her lair

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.600
to gather the humanity that heals her dying sister.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.160
That is until she is killed by the Chosen Undead.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:02.020
So, who will take care of her now that her sister is gone?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:08.720
Queelag? Please, sister, do not cry.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:11.940
I am happy, really.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.920
I have you...

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:18.180
...don't I?"

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:26.280
Darkwraith Kirk, Knight of Thorns has tricked Darkstalker Kaathe out of a Red Eye Orb.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:31.200
He invades worlds to steal humanity to heal the Fair Lady, rather than give them to Kaathe.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.480
His actions reveal that not all darkwraiths are evil.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:39.400
However, he is ultimately killed by the Chosen Undead

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:44.300
as his intentions are not understood until his corpse is found in the Fair Lady's company.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.040
Time in Lordran is convoluted.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:52.280
One undead may replace Quelaag out of guilt.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.360
Another may choose to put The Fair Lady out of her misery.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.500
"Quelaag… But...

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.840
...why?"

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.040
"Why... you monster!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:17.500
The Fair lady! What have you done... What have you done?"

